<view class="qx qx-flow"><view class="qx-flow-content"><view class="qx-sheet qx-address" bindtap="addresses"><view wx:if="{{address}}"><view>{{address.recipient}} {{address.phone}}</view><view class="qx-muted">{{address.province}} {{address.city}} {{address.district}} {{address.detail}}</view></view><view wx:else>请选择收货地址 ›</view></view><view wx:if="{{sales}}" class="qx-sheet"><view>本单销售代理：{{sales.name}}（{{sales.identity === 'B' ? '主理人' : '店主'}}）</view><checkbox-group bindchange="confirmSales"><label><checkbox value="confirmed" checked="{{salesConfirmed}}" />确认本单销售归属</label></checkbox-group><button class="qx-text" bindtap="removeSales">移除代理，按无代理购买</button></view><view wx:if="{{hasSalesCode && !sales}}" class="qx-sheet"><view>销售分享暂不可用，请核对提示后选择是否移除。</view><button class="qx-text" bindtap="removeSales">移除分享，按无代理购买</button></view><view wx:if="{{quote}}"><view class="qx-sheet"><view class="qx-label">清欣简妍肌品牌仓</view><view wx:for="{{quote.lines}}" wx:key="skuId" class="qx-order-line"><image src="{{item.image}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view><view>{{item.name}}</view><view class="qx-muted">{{item.skuName}}{{item.productType === 'welfare' ? ' · 福利品统一价' : ''}}</view></view><view class="qx-line-end">{{item.priceText}}<view class="qx-muted">×{{item.quantity}}</view></view></view><view class="qx-info-row"><text>配送说明</text><text>{{quote.shippingInstructions}}</text></view></view><view class="qx-sheet"><view class="qx-info-row"><text>商品合计</text><text>{{quote.goodsText}}</text></view><view class="qx-info-row"><text>运费</text><text>{{quote.shippingText}}</text></view><view class="qx-info-row"><text>应付总额</text><text class="qx-price">{{quote.totalText}}</text></view></view><view class="qx-notice">确认后生成待核款订单并暂时占用库存；请按订单说明线下付款，财务核款后发货。代理可使用已有积分订货，同身份两种方式同价。仅创建订单不会扣款或扣积分。</view></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{quote}}" class="qx-fixed"><view><view class="qx-muted">需支付</view><view class="qx-price">{{quote.totalText}}</view></view><button class="qx-primary" bindtap="submit" disabled="{{busy}}" loading="{{busy}}">确认并生成订单</button></view></view>
